#
# D-84 runtime import allowlist. OWNER-CONTROLLED (CLAUDE.md §1).
#
# Every import in lib/isedraf/ must name a module on this list; anything else fails
# `make check-imports`, and a missing, empty or malformed list fails closed. The first-party
# package `isedraf` is always permitted. The network and database modules D-84 names are
# refused even if listed here.
#
# Each entry is a Python 3.6 standard-library module (D-12 production floor): the list is
# never derived from whichever interpreter runs CI. One top-level name per line, sorted.
# Initial content: exactly the modules the runtime imported on 2026-09-23.
argparse
base64
binascii
datetime
errno
fcntl
fnmatch
hashlib
json
os
re
secrets
shutil
stat
struct
subprocess
sys
